Z||000005||Fformula88||12-12-2001||09:43 PM||||I picked up a new leather GT style wheel from Fiero store.  Its a reproduction and not a re-covered one, which probably doesn't make much difference.<P>It was a little pricey, but I wanted to keep the stock look and stay away from the aftermarket wheels.  I am very pleased with it and have had it since about April with no complaints.  Quality seems really good so far.<P>I am happy with it, but can certainly see why some people may balk at its price.<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/formulasig.JPG">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">    <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
